<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάμν-ος</span></b> , ὁ, also ἡ
		<i><span class="en">
			Hermipp.
			82.7
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Eratosth.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Ath.
			11.499e
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
			9.4
		</span></i>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>earthen
			jar</i> or <i>bottle for racking off wine</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασταμνίζω</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				545
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				531
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.32
			</span></i>: generally, <i>jar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.89
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μέλιτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ki.</u>
					12.24h
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. χρυσῆ ἔχουσα τὸ μάννα</span>
			<u>Ep.Hebr.</u> l.c.; used to keep money in, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				76
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				46.35
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; as a ballot-box, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jahresh.</u>
				23
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Beibl.</u>
				75
			</span></i> (Pygela, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>); as a measure, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐλαίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					900.27
				</span></i>
			 (Panamara, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφορέα: τὸν δίωτον στάμνον, Ἀττικῶς, στάμνον,
				Ἑλληνικῶς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Moer.
				p.44
			</span></i> P.</div>
